{"id":"e2ade50b86346886","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-l-implies-4.md","title":"L Implies 4 Lemma","display":"lem-l-implies-4 — L Implies 4 Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-l-implies-4","aliases":["89-lem-l-implies-4"],"display":"lem-l-implies-4 — L Implies 4 Lemma","depends_on":["[[89-df-lob-axiom]]","[[89-df-4-axiom]]","[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-l-implies-4"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-l-implies-4</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-l-implies-4 — L Implies 4 Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"491579297d817026\" href=\"?note=491579297d817026\" title=\"89-df-lob-axiom\">89-df-lob-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"883bfda9f28cc5ea\" href=\"?note=883bfda9f28cc5ea\" title=\"89-df-4-axiom\">89-df-4-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bdef52f3ff411531\" href=\"?note=bdef52f3ff411531\" title=\"89-df-normal-modal-logic\">89-df-normal-modal-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\Lambda\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(\\Lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}(\\Lambda)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}_{L}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}_{4}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}_{4}\\)</span> are the Löb and 4 axiom schemas.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}l\\text{-}implies\\text{-}4}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Normal}(\\Lambda)\n\\land\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\Lambda\n\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathcal{A}_{4}\\subseteq\\Lambda.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}l\\text{-}implies\\text{-}4}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Normal}(\\Lambda)\n\\land\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\Lambda\n\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathcal{A}_{4}\\subseteq\\Lambda.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}_{L}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\)</span> : Löb 公理的全部模式实例</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}_{4}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}_{4}\\)</span> : 4 公理的全部模式实例</li>\n<li>Löb公理推出公理4</li>\n<li>因此GL包含K4</li>\n</ul>\n<p>短证明：对任意 A 令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=A\\land\\Box A\">\\(D=A\\land\\Box A\\)</span>。K 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box D\\to\\Box A\">\\(\\Box D\\to\\Box A\\)</span>，命题推理得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to(\\Box D\\to D)\">\\(A\\to(\\Box D\\to D)\\)</span>。必然化及 K 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\\to\\Box(\\Box D\\to D)\">\\(\\Box A\\to\\Box(\\Box D\\to D)\\)</span>。对 D 用 Löb 公理得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\\to\\Box D\">\\(\\Box A\\to\\Box D\\)</span>，再由 D 的第二投影及 K 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box D\\to\\Box\\Box A\">\\(\\Box D\\to\\Box\\Box A\\)</span>，合成所需实例。所有步骤只用正规逻辑的规则与给定 Löb 模式。\n来源：Boolos，第 1 章 pp.11–12，Theorem 18；印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-lob-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"491579297d817026","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-lob-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-4-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"883bfda9f28cc5ea","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-4-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-normal-modal-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bdef52f3ff411531","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Lambda\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}(\\Lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{A}_{L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{A}_{4}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}l\\text{-}implies\\text{-}4}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Normal}(\\Lambda)\n\\land\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\Lambda\n\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathcal{A}_{4}\\subseteq\\Lambda.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{A}_{L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{A}_{4}","display":false},{"tex":"D=A\\land\\Box A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box D\\to\\Box A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to(\\Box D\\to D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box A\\to\\Box(\\Box D\\to D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box A\\to\\Box D","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box D\\to\\Box\\Box A","display":false}],"bytes":1332,"backlinks":[{"id":"e5df5e5db2baf133","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c3a5b525cfd233c2","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"关键非定义步骤是 Löb 公理在正常模态逻辑中导出公理 4，见\n[[89-lem-l-implies-4]]；因此 K4 的闭包包含于 GL。"},{"id":"ffd0dbc00149f28a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a504f38ba12874d6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"最后一个等价的短证明：框架有效式构成正规逻辑，Löb 有效性经 [[89-lem-l-implies-4]] 给出 4 有效性；若 $wRx,xRy$ 而非 $wRy$，取 $p$ 只在 $y$ 为假即反驳 4，故 $R$ 传递。若有非空 $X\\subseteq W$ 且每个 $x\\in X$ 都有 $X$ 中的后继，取 $p$ 恰在 $X$ 为假；此时 $\\Box p\\to p$ 在每个世界为真，Löb 公理却在 $X$ 中为假，故 $R$ 逆良基。反向若传递且逆良基，在任意世界的假 $p$ 后继集非空时取其无 $R$ 后继元素 $x$；传递性使 $x$ 满足 $\\Box p\\land\\neg p$，于是该世界不能满足 $\\Box(\\Box p\\to p)$。"},{"id":"7c3acbd110a662db","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ff346ee0085d8f22","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"来源：Boolos, *The Logic of Provability*，第 11 章，印刷页 148–154；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n由 [[89-lem-henkin-frame-correspondence]]，框架验证 H 当且仅当它是 GL 框架：在全赋值语义下，单字母 Henkin 公式的有效性也验证全部替换实例，MP 与必然化保框架有效性。由 [[89-ex-cresswell-henkin-model]] 的固定赋值模型，H 的全部定理在所有世界为真，但 4 在 $2^*$ 为假，故 4 不属于 H。GL 由 Löb 公理验证全部 Henkin 实例，因而 $\\mathrm H\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}$；[[89-lem-l-implies-4]] 又给出 $4\\in\\mathrm{GL}$，得到严格包含。任何验证 H 的框架类都会验证 4，因此不能完整刻画 H。模型有效性和框架有效性在此分别量化，不能互换。"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-419","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-l-implies-4]]"}],"outgoing":["491579297d817026","883bfda9f28cc5ea","bdef52f3ff411531"]}